<div class="warning">
  <div class="warning-title">⚠️ 辅助功能权限 / Accessibility Permission</div>
  <p>本次起使用稳定代码签名。若升级后「合并多窗口 / 标题显示」无效：系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能，选中 RetroWin 点 <b>−</b> 移除后重启应用并重新允许。之后同一签名升级通常无需再授权。</p>
  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #FFECB5;margin:8px 0;">
  <p>Builds now use a stable code signature. If merge-windows / title display stop working after this update: System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Accessibility → select RetroWin → <b>−</b>, relaunch, and Allow again. Later updates with the same signature should keep the grant.</p>
</div>
]]></description>
